+ compile

= a deliberate conversion, never an accident:
=
= ```scala fuel
= compile
- errors show
+ errors show

= a deliberate conversion, never an accident:
=
= ```scala fuel
= compile
= errors show
- ##
+ ##

- val mixed: S32 = small
+ val mixed: S32 = small

= val mixed: S32 = small
- ```
